sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor A as Strategy Author
    participant UI as Web Authoring UI
    participant GO as Go Edge API
    participant API as Python Research API
    participant ORCH as AgentOrchestrator
    participant D as StrategyDesignerAgent
    participant I as StrategyImplementationAgent
    participant R as StrategyRepairAgent
    participant VAL as Spec Validator
    participant CMP as Deterministic Compiler/Policy
    participant SB as Isolated Sandbox
    participant DB as Python State/Artifact Store
    participant REV as Human ApprovalService
    participant REG as Python StrategyRegistry

    A->>UI: submit text, DSL or URL
    UI->>GO: POST /strategy-drafts with idempotency key
    GO->>GO: auth, quota, bounded body and correlation ID
    GO->>API: signed command with principal context
    API->>DB: persist draft/source/agent run
    API->>ORCH: schedule persisted workflow

    alt URL source
        ORCH->>API: Safe Source Ingestor fetches allowlisted URL
        API->>DB: persist sanitized content hash and source evidence
    end

    ORCH->>D: typed tool session only
    D->>VAL: validate StrategySpec proposal
    alt missing intent or invalid nonrepairable spec
        VAL-->>ORCH: structured errors/questions
        ORCH->>DB: persist FAILED or AWAITING_INPUT evidence
    else validated spec
        VAL-->>ORCH: immutable spec revision
        ORCH->>I: typed tool session only
        I->>CMP: compile DSL or create advanced custom draft
        CMP->>CMP: AST/import/API policy check
        alt policy passes
            CMP-->>I: artifact hash + compiler provenance
            I->>SB: run no-network contract/fixture/parity tests
            SB-->>ORCH: structured report + resource evidence
        else policy fails
            CMP-->>ORCH: structured policy failure
        end

        loop at most configured repair attempts, default 3
            alt report/policy failed and budget remains
                ORCH->>R: immutable context + structured evidence
                R->>VAL: patch spec or artifact through typed tools
                VAL-->>ORCH: revised immutable revision
                ORCH->>I: compile/policy/sandbox again
            end
        end

        alt final report passes
            ORCH->>DB: freeze spec/artifact/report hashes at REVIEW_REQUIRED
            API-->>GO: persisted progress event
            GO-->>UI: WebSocket progress/fan-out
            A->>UI: explicit approve exact review hash
            UI->>GO: POST /strategy-drafts/{id}/approve
            GO->>API: signed approval command
            API->>REV: verify owner, state and exact hashes
            REV->>DB: atomic immutable StrategyVersion/provenance
            REV->>REG: admit approved DSL version or create custom-code PR/build task
            REG-->>API: idempotent publish result
            API-->>GO: approved version event
            GO-->>UI: strategy version available
        else final report fails or budget exhausted
            ORCH->>DB: persist FAILED with evidence, never publish
        end
    end

    Note over D,R: No generic shell, SQL, HTTP, filesystem, secret, approve or publish capability.
    Note over SB,REG: Passing tests reaches REVIEW_REQUIRED, not automatic publishing.
